    {
      "cn_text": "艾伦的贡献在于，他揭示了一个我们都默认的假设——因为我们不是机器人，所以能控制自己的思想——并揭露其错误本质。",
      "en_text": "Allen’s contribution was to take an assumption we all share — that because we are not robots we therefore control our thoughts — and reveal its erroneous nature.",
