    {
      "cn_text": "由于我们大多数人认为心灵独立于物质之外,便以为思想可以隐藏起来并使其失去力量;这使得我们可以想法是一套,做法又是另一套。",
      "en_text": "Because most of us believe that mind is separate from matter, we think that thoughts can be hidden and made powerless; this allows us to think one way and act another.",
      "id": 2011013230,
      "order_seq": "content_2_2",
      "task_id": 201101007,
