    {
      "cn_text": "由于欲望和意志会因与欲望不符的思想的存在而受损,艾伦得出结论:「我们吸引的不是我们想要的东西,而是我们所是的样子。」",
      "en_text": "Since desire and will are damaged by the presence of thoughts that do not accord with desire, Allen concluded: “We do not attract what we want, but what we are.”",
      "id": 2011013232,
      "order_seq": "content_3_1",
      "task_id": 201101007,
